  "description": "Rare technical alignment in the financial sector triggered buy signals",
  "body_html": "<p>If you didn’t see my <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF Build Video</a>, check it out…this was an in depth research project, selecting only 10 stocks with incredibly high potential out of more than 8,000. What’s even more promising, is that all of the bullish chart structures were on the monthly time frame; meaning the reliability is far higher and I expect the trends to last much longer. </p><p>I set alerts and wanted to monitor these stocks for a few days before buying anything. I built a mock portfolio of those ETF’s…and the ETF has significantly more strength, and performance, over the S&amp;P 500, a really good signal for us.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!THOk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc82e03c-13c2-43f1-8c46-5bff9cb01823_910x443.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!THOk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc82e03c-13c2-43f1-8c46-5bff9cb01823_910x443.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!THOk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc82e03c-13c2-43f1-8c46-5bff9cb01823_910x443.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!THOk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc82e03c-13c2-43f1-8c46-5bff9cb01823_910x443.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!THOk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%